{"chapter":{"blocks":[{"text":"写在最后","type":"TITLE"},{"text":"本节学习：写在最后。讲义保留原有示例与练习，可结合正文向教师提问。","type":"PARAGRAPH"},{"text":"这 13 个活动不需要电脑，但它们讲的就是计算机最核心的道理：二进制、一步步指令、比较排序、加密、网络寄信、计算思维。\n\n以后你坐在电脑前写 Scratch 的时候，会突然想起这些游戏——原来积木背后是这个道理。\n\n计算机科学不是一门要考试的课，它是一种新的思考方式。玩着玩着，你就学会了。","type":"MARKDOWN"}],"grade_max":6,"grade_min":4,"knowledge_points":[{"description":"学习并解释「写在最后」中的核心概念与示例。","name":"写在最后","slug":"primary-unplugged-topic-09","topic":"计算机与人工智能"}],"license_code":"UNKNOWN","objectives":["解释「写在最后」的主要概念，并结合示例完成文中练习。"],"order_index":19,"revision":1,"slug":"ch-009-upper","source":{"conversion":"supplied-markdown-v1","original_sha256":"6de19a2592a23d9257857f76aafef11f5d3ed503bb0f4c91fa9e4af8b4016676","source_commit":null,"source_path":"sources/6de19a2592a23d92/05-不插电的计算机科学.md"},"stage":"PRIMARY_UPPER","title":"写在最后"},"content_hash":"890658edbdffb9574fdcd4a6b7e4bcd174efe3960f3547a01febda7bfb5b7975","course":{"slug":"primary-unplugged","title":"不插电的计算机科学","topic":"计算机与人工智能"},"is_test_fixture":false,"manifest_hash":"b2500e5121455aa9339fe6399902e89a0917eaf9bd814708a6dc69af397b6b20","release_key":"computing-ai-md-v1-db6ffb6b663b","schema_version":"k12.content.revision-snapshot.v1","source_kind":"NEW_SOURCE"}
